https://bugs.mysql.com/bug.php?id=120639 Verified as described.

MySQL 9.6 在 indexed integer column 上，
对 WHERE NOT (IFNULL(non-integer numeric constant, ...) NOT IN (indexed_col)) 的聚合计数执行了错误的索引优化。
逐行谓词为 false，但 COUNT(*) 返回 1。

DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS test_db2;
CREATE DATABASE test_db2;
USE test_db2;

CREATE TABLE s (
  id BIGINT NOT NULL,
  KEY(id)
) ENGINE=InnoDB;

INSERT INTO s VALUES (1);

SELECT COUNT(*) AS cnt
FROM s
WHERE NOT (IFNULL(0.5, 0) NOT IN (id));

SELECT id,
       NOT (IFNULL(0.5, 0) NOT IN (id)) AS pred
FROM s;

实际结果：
cnt = 1

id | pred
1  | 0

期望结果：cnt = 0

-- 对照 1：无索引，结果正确
CREATE TABLE s_plain (
  id BIGINT NOT NULL
) ENGINE=InnoDB;

INSERT INTO s_plain VALUES (1);

SELECT COUNT(*) AS cnt
FROM s_plain
WHERE NOT (IFNULL(0.5, 0) NOT IN (id));
-- returns 0, correct


-- 对照 2：不使用 IFNULL，结果正确
SELECT COUNT(*) AS cnt
FROM s
WHERE NOT (0.5 NOT IN (id));
-- returns 0, correct

这两个对照说明：

不是 SQL 三值逻辑问题；
不是 NOT IN 本身问题；
不是 0.5 和 1 比较的问题；
是 indexed column + IFNULL(non-integer)

EXPLAIN FORMAT=TREE
SELECT COUNT(*) AS cnt
FROM s
WHERE NOT (IFNULL(0.5, 0) NOT IN (id));

EXPLAIN FORMAT=TREE
SELECT id,
       NOT (IFNULL(0.5, 0) NOT IN (id)) AS pred
FROM s;

EXPLAIN FORMAT=TREE
SELECT COUNT(*) AS cnt
FROM s_plain
WHERE NOT (IFNULL(0.5, 0) NOT IN (id));

mysql> EXPLAIN FORMAT=TREE
    -> SELECT COUNT(*) AS cnt
    -> FROM s
    -> WHERE NOT (IFNULL(0.5, 0) NOT IN (id));
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| EXPLAIN                                                                                                                       |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| -> Aggregate: count(0)  (cost=0.45 rows=1)
    -> Covering index lookup on s using id (id=ifnull(0.5,0))  (cost=0.35 rows=1)
 |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
1 row in set (0.00 sec)

mysql> 
mysql> EXPLAIN FORMAT=TREE
    -> SELECT id,
    ->        NOT (IFNULL(0.5, 0) NOT IN (id)) AS pred
    -> FROM s;
+--------------------------------------------------+
| EXPLAIN                                          |
+--------------------------------------------------+
| -> Index scan on s using id  (cost=0.35 rows=1)
 |
+--------------------------------------------------+
1 row in set (0.00 sec)

mysql> 
mysql> EXPLAIN FORMAT=TREE
    -> SELECT COUNT(*) AS cnt
    -> FROM s_plain
    -> WHERE NOT (IFNULL(0.5, 0) NOT IN (id));
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| EXPLAIN                                                                                                                                                                   |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| -> Aggregate: count(0)  (cost=0.45 rows=1)
    -> Filter: (<cache>(ifnull(0.5,0)) = s_plain.id)  (cost=0.35 rows=1)
        -> Table scan on s_plain  (cost=0.35 rows=1)
 |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
1 row in set (0.00 sec)


MySQL 8.0.46: COUNT(*) over indexed integer column returns 1 although WHERE predicate evaluates to false

For a table with an index on BIGINT column id, MySQL returns COUNT(*) = 1 for:

WHERE NOT (IFNULL(0.5, 0) NOT IN (id))

However, evaluating the same predicate row by row returns 0 for the only row. Without the index, or without IFNULL(), COUNT(*) correctly returns 0.

VP single query 直接访问带索引/主键的 vp_source，触发错误 index/count 优化；
VP split query 经 derived/CTE reconstruction，改变访问路径，返回正确 0；
因此 single/split mismatch 揭示了 optimizer bug。